\section{Mathematical Expressions}

Simple equation:

\[
x + y = 10
\]

Fraction:

\[
\frac{a}{b}
\]

Square root:

\[
\sqrt{x}
\]

Power:

\[
x^2
\]

Subscript:

\[
x_1
\]

Quadratic formula:

\[
x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}
\]

Aligned equations:

\begin{align}
x + y &= 10 \\
x - y &= 2
\end{align}

